    "---\n",
    "## 3. IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection Dataset (SECONDARY)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Source:** Vesta Corporation via Kaggle competition (IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection, 2019)  \n",
    "**License:** Competition rules — for research/academic use  \n",
    "**Status:** Real-world e-commerce transactions  \n",
    "**Scope:** Two separate files — Transaction + Identity — joined via `TransactionID`  \n",
    "**Note:** Many features are anonymised (V1–V339, C1–C14, D1–D15, M1–M9)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Role: SECONDARY\n",
    "- 394 columns in transaction file (complex, high missingness)\n",
    "- Requires merging two files — significant data engineering overhead\n",
    "- May be used for cross-dataset generalisation experiments\n",
    "- Will NOT be the primary training dataset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load only the first 50,000 rows for schema inspection\n",
    "# Full dataset (590,540 rows × 394 cols) is ~1.3GB — not loaded in full here\n",
